@* Bảng kết quả báo cáo + biểu đồ cột ngang (dùng chung cho báo cáo chuẩn / động / chạy thử) *@
@using CRM.Web.Infrastructure.Reports
@model ReportResult
@{
    var inv = System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture;
    var chartRows = Model.ChartLabel >= 0 && Model.ChartValue >= 0
        ? Model.Rows.Select(r => (Label: ReportResult.Format(r[Model.ChartLabel], Model.Columns[Model.ChartLabel].Kind), Value: ReportResult.ToDecimal(r[Model.ChartValue]) ?? 0))
            .Where(x => x.Value != 0).OrderByDescending(x => x.Value).Take(15).ToList()
        : new();
    var max = chartRows.Count > 0 ? Math.Max(1m, chartRows.Max(x => Math.Abs(x.Value))) : 1m;
}
@if (chartRows.Count > 1)
{
    <div class="card mb-3 report-chart">
        <div class="card-header">@Icon("trending") @Model.Columns[Model.ChartValue].Title
            @if (Model.Rows.Count > chartRows.Count) { <span class="small text-muted fw-normal">· @T("{0} giá trị lớn nhất", chartRows.Count)</span> }</div>
        <div class="card-body">
            @foreach (var x in chartRows)
            {
                <div class="bar-row">
                    <div class="lbl" title="@x.Label">@x.Label</div>
                    <div class="bar"><div class="@(x.Value < 0 ? "neg" : "")" style="width:@((Math.Abs(x.Value) * 100m / max).ToString("0.#", inv))%"></div></div>
                    <div class="val">@(Model.Columns[Model.ChartValue].Kind == ReportColumnKind.Money ? x.Value.ToShortMoney() : ReportResult.Format(x.Value, Model.Columns[Model.ChartValue].Kind))</div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
}
<div class="card"><div class="card-body p-0 table-responsive">
<table class="table table-hover table-sm mb-0 report-table" data-grid="@(ViewData["GridKey"] as string)">
    <thead><tr>
        @foreach (var c in Model.Columns) { <th class="@(c.IsNumeric ? "money" : "")">@c.Title</th> }
    </tr></thead>
    <tbody>
    @foreach (var row in Model.Rows)
    {
        <tr>
            @for (var i = 0; i < Model.Columns.Count; i++)
            {
                var c = Model.Columns[i];
                var neg = c.IsNumeric && (ReportResult.ToDecimal(row[i]) ?? 0) < 0;
                <td class="@(c.IsNumeric ? "money" : "") @(neg ? "text-danger" : "")">@ReportResult.Format(row[i], c.Kind)</td>
            }
        </tr>
    }
    @if (!Model.Rows.Any()) { <tr><td colspan="@Math.Max(1, Model.Columns.Count)" class="text-center text-muted p-4">@T("Không có dữ liệu phù hợp.")</td></tr> }
    </tbody>
    @if (Model.Totals != null && Model.Rows.Any())
    {
        <tfoot><tr class="fw-bold">
            @for (var i = 0; i < Model.Columns.Count; i++) { <td class="@(Model.Columns[i].IsNumeric ? "money" : "")">@ReportResult.Format(Model.Totals[i], Model.Columns[i].Kind)</td> }
        </tr></tfoot>
    }
</table>
</div>
<div class="card-footer bg-white small text-muted d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-2">
    <span>@T("{0} dòng", Model.Rows.Count.ToString("N0"))</span>
    @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(Model.Note)) { <span>@Model.Note</span> }
</div></div>
